{"markdown": "Back to Models\n\n This model is deprecated by newer models.\n\njina-embeddings-v5-text-small\n\n Embeddings\n\n CC BY-NC 4.0\n\n Release Post\n\njina-embeddings-v3\n==========\n\nFrontier multilingual embedding model with SOTA performance\n\nLicense\n\n CC-BY-NC-4.0\n\nRelease Date\n\n2024-09-18\n\nInput\n\nText\n\nOutput\n\nVector\n\nMatryoshka Dimensions\n\n32\n\n64\n\n128\n\n256\n\n512\n\n768\n\n1024\n\nLate Chunking\n\n Yes\n\nModel Details\n\nParameters: 570M\n\nInput Token Length: 8K\n\nOutput Dimension: 1024\n\nBase Model\n\njina-xlm-roberta\n\nTrained Languages\n\n32 languages\n\nSupported Languages\n\n108 languages\n\nRelated Models\n\njina-embeddings-v2-base-en\n\njina-embeddings-v2-base-zh\n\njina-embeddings-v2-base-de\n\njina-embeddings-v2-base-es\n\njina-embeddings-v2-base-code\n\nSupported Tasks\n\n Retrieval\n\n Text Matching\n\n Separation\n\n Classification\n\nAvailable via\n\n[\n\n Elastic Inference Service\n\n](https://www.elastic.co/docs/explore-analyze/elastic-inference/eis)[\n\n Jina API\n\n](https://jina.ai/?sui&model=jina-embeddings-v3)[\n\n AWS SageMaker\n\n](https://aws.amazon.com/marketplace/seller-profile?id=seller-stch2ludm6vgy)[\n\n Microsoft Azure\n\n](https://azuremarketplace.microsoft.com/en-US/marketplace/apps?page=1&search=jina)[\n\n Google Cloud\n\n](https://console.cloud.google.com/marketplace/browse?q=jina)[\n\n Hugging Face\n\n](https://huggingface.co/jinaai/jina-embeddings-v3)[\n\n Air-gapped\n\n](https://github.com/jina-ai/jina-on-prem/wiki/Model-Catalog)\n\nI/O graph\n\n\\#diagram-jina-embeddings-v3-0{font-family:monospace;font-size:16px;fill:#000000;}@keyframes edge-animation-frame{from{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}@keyframes dash{to{stroke-dashoffset:0;}}#diagram-jina-embeddings-v3-0 .edge-animation-slow{stroke-dasharray:9,5!important;stroke-dashoffset:900;animation:dash 50s linear infinite;stroke-linecap:round;}#diagram-jina-embeddings-v3-0 .edge-animation-fast{stroke-dasharray:9,5!important;stroke-dashoffset:900;